# Example self_agent_profile.md

This is a template showing the expected structure of the persistent persona
profile. The real `self_agent_profile.md` is gitignored (personal data) and
is never committed.

## How to seed this file

Copy the content of your existing Claude Code project-memory persona file
(a markdown memory file under `~/.claude/projects/<project>/memory/`, if you
have one) into `config/self_agent_profile.md` as the initial value. Do not
commit that file's path or content anywhere in this repo.

## Expected sections

```markdown
---
name: self-agent-profile
description: One-line summary of the persona this profile tracks
metadata:
  type: user
---

# Core motivations (updated weekly)

- <durable pattern 1>
- <durable pattern 2>

# Behavior patterns

- <durable pattern observed from judgment-loop logs>

# Recent notes (most recent week first)

## <date>

- <notable but not-yet-durable observation>
```
